            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "A complete analysis will reveal what’s troubling your feet",
            "text": "<h4><strong>1. Examination on the Footscan device<\/strong><\/h4><p>It analyses your gait and shows which part of the foot you use in the individual phases of the step and how.<\/p><h4>2. Assessment of insoles and shoes<\/h4><p>From the way your shoes are worn, the specialist can tell which part of the foot you’re overloading. <\/p><h4>3. Consultation with a physiotherapist<\/h4><p>Physiotherapist Lenka Exnerová will examine you and assess your gait. She’ll advise you on exercises and recommend suitable shoes.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#202020",
            "hd_color": "#202020",
