            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "center",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<h6>At the Prague store, you'll be welcomed by <\/h6><h2>Mgr. et Bc. Lenka Exnerová<\/h2><p>She studied physiotherapy and occupational therapy and has worked, for example, at <strong>Thomayer University Hospital<\/strong> in Krč.<br\/>She taught occupational therapy and rehabilitation at the <strong>First Faculty of Medicine of Charles University<\/strong>. <\/p><p>In her practice, she always looks at the <strong>person as a whole<\/strong>. She looks for the cause of your difficulties and then, together with you, designs therapy that you'll enjoy and that will make sense to you.<\/p>",
